# Keeps the build context (and thus image layers) lean. Neither image
# needs notebooks, raw/processed data (regenerated inside api/Dockerfile),
# pre-built models (gitignored anyway, and rebuilt fresh at image build
# time -- see api/Dockerfile), tests, or docs.
#
# NOT excluded on purpose: data/processed/fd001_sensor_selection.json,
# which api/Dockerfile copies in for the FD001 export.
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.streamlit/
# Local virtual environments -- often hundreds of MB, and the images
# install their own dependencies anyway.
.venv/
venv/
env/
notebooks/
docs/
tests/
data/raw/
data/processed/*.parquet
data/processed/*.csv
data/processed/*.npy
models/
*.md